1
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:09,160
Compress gas cylinders, installation and removal of a regulator.
压缩气瓶：减压阀的安装与拆卸。

2
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:20,600
Before installing your regulator, know the properties and hazards of the gas you are using.
在安装减压阀之前，要了解你所使用气体的性质和危害。

3
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:24,880
The safety data sheet should have this information, or you can contact the manufacturer.
安全数据表上应有这些信息，或者你可以联系制造商。

4
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:32,540
Secure the gas cylinder with a chain or appropriate belt above the midpoint but below the shoulder.
用链条或合适的绑带在中点以上、瓶肩以下的位置固定气瓶。

5
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:35,140
Remove the cylinder cap.
取下瓶帽。

6
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:39,860
Use a cylinder cap hook to help loosen the tight cylinder caps if needed.
如有需要，可使用瓶帽钩帮助松开拧得很紧的瓶帽。

7
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:44,900
Never apply excessive force to pry off caps.
切勿用过大的力撬开瓶帽。

8
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:47,820
Make sure to select the correct style of regulator.
一定要选择正确型号的减压阀。

9
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:53,380
The CGA number on the valve should match the CGA number on the regulator.
气瓶阀上的 CGA 编号应与减压阀上的 CGA 编号一致。

10
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:57,020
Never use adapters to connect cylinders to regulators.
切勿使用转接头将气瓶连接到减压阀上。

11
00:00:57,020 --> 00:01:06,180
Perform a visual inspection before each use to detect any damage, cracks, corrosion or other defects.
每次使用前进行目视检查，以发现任何损坏、裂纹、腐蚀或其他缺陷。

12
00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:12,730
Ensure the regulator pressure control valve is closed before attaching it to the cylinder.
在将减压阀连接到气瓶之前，确保减压阀的压力调节阀处于关闭状态。

13
00:01:12,730 --> 00:01:21,500
Never use Teflon tape on cylinders or tube fitting connections.
切勿在气瓶或管接头连接处使用生料带。

14
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:23,820
Thread the regulator into the cylinder.
将减压阀拧入气瓶。

15
00:01:23,820 --> 00:01:28,980
When attaching the regulator, do not stand in line with the regulator and valve outlet.
连接减压阀时，不要站在减压阀和阀门出口的正对方向上。

16
00:01:28,980 --> 00:01:38,760
If the regulator will not fit into the cylinder, this indicates that the incorrect regulator is being used.
如果减压阀无法与气瓶配合，说明使用的减压阀不对。

17
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:48,900
Tighten first by hand and then use a smooth jawed wrench.
先用手拧紧，然后使用光面扳手。

18
00:01:48,900 --> 00:01:50,940
Do not over and tighten the fitting.
不要把接头拧得过紧。

19
00:01:50,940 --> 00:01:54,700
Most fittings are brass and can be easily warped.
大多数接头是黄铜的，很容易变形。

20
00:01:54,700 --> 00:02:03,500
For flammables or oxidizing gases, ensure your tools are non-sparking.
对于易燃气体或氧化性气体，确保你的工具是防爆不产生火花的。

21
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:09,430
Pressurize the regulator slowly by opening the main tank valve first.
先打开气瓶总阀，缓慢地给减压阀加压。

22
00:02:09,430 --> 00:02:15,590
Ensure the valve outlets and regulators are pointed away from the personnel when the cylinder valves are open.
打开气瓶阀时，确保阀门出口和减压阀朝向远离人员的方向。

23
00:02:15,590 --> 00:02:24,810
Adjust secondary valve until the proper pressure has been achieved.
调节二级阀，直到达到合适的压力。

24
00:02:24,810 --> 00:02:31,810
Check the connection for leaks using either a bubble or pressure test depending on the type of gas you are using.
根据所用气体的类型，采用气泡法或压力测试对连接处进行检漏。

25
00:02:31,810 --> 00:02:40,950
If there is a leak, close the main tank valve to ensure there is no further leak.
如果有泄漏，关闭气瓶总阀，确保不再继续泄漏。

26
00:02:40,950 --> 00:02:45,850
Then tighten the connection again with a wrench.
然后用扳手再次拧紧连接处。

27
00:02:45,850 --> 00:02:52,600
If the leak remains after the nut is fully tightened, the regulator may need to be replaced.
如果螺母完全拧紧后仍有泄漏，可能需要更换减压阀。

28
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:57,680
Once the regulator is installed, there are no leaks and the gas supply is connected to your application.
一旦减压阀安装完毕、没有泄漏，并且气源已连接到你的用气设备上，

29
00:02:57,680 --> 00:03:01,580
The gas is now ready for use.
气体就可以使用了。

30
00:03:01,580 --> 00:03:08,820
When using flammable or toxic gases, the relief valve should be vented to a fume hood or other ventilation source.
使用易燃或有毒气体时，泄压阀应排放到通风橱或其他通风设施中。

31
00:03:08,820 --> 00:03:15,780
To improve the lifespan and accuracy of your regulator, do not keep the regulator pressurized when it is not in use.
为了延长减压阀的使用寿命并提高其准确度，不使用时不要让减压阀保持带压状态。

32
00:03:15,780 --> 00:03:19,380
When you are finished working, shut off the main tank valve first.
工作结束后，先关闭气瓶总阀。

33
00:03:19,380 --> 00:03:27,510
Allow the gas to bleed out of the regulator and then close the regulator outlet valve if you have one.
让气体从减压阀中泄放出来，然后如果有减压阀出口阀，就把它关闭。

34
00:03:27,510 --> 00:03:34,550
Before removing the regulator, verify that the cylinder valve is closed and the regulator and the system lines are depressurized.
在拆卸减压阀之前，确认气瓶阀已关闭，减压阀和系统管路已泄压。

35
00:03:34,550 --> 00:03:43,380
To remove the regulator, loosen the nut with a wrench first, then by hand.
拆卸减压阀时，先用扳手松开螺母，然后再用手拧下。

36
00:03:43,380 --> 00:03:46,260
After removing the regulator, replace the cap.
拆下减压阀后，装回瓶帽。

37
00:03:46,260 --> 00:03:50,220
The cap protects the valve while in storage and during transport.
在储存和运输期间，瓶帽可以保护阀门。

38
00:03:50,220 --> 00:03:55,660
For more information about gas cylinders, check out the Gas Cylinder Safety Guidelines Manual linked below.
有关气瓶的更多信息，请查看下方链接的《气瓶安全指南手册》。

39
00:03:55,660 --> 00:03:59,220
If you have questions, please contact ISUEHNS.
如有疑问，请联系 ISU EH&S。
